      "body": "<!-- coderabbit-ai-generated:v1 -->\n\n<!-- This is an auto-generated comment: summarize by coderabbit.ai -->\n<!-- review_stack_entry_start -->\n\n<a href=\"https://app.coderabbit.ai/change-stack/hasansyed-proofline/bench-coderabbit/pull/7?scope=ghh_OusAJGA4HG8ljoOV0wJvVx8NmnZIjc2DdjmxOu0xZWA&amp;cs_source=review_comment\"><picture><source media=\"(prefers-color-scheme: dark)\" srcset=\"https://storage.googleapis.com/coderabbit_public_assets/review-stack-buttons-v1/explain-change-dark.svg\"><source media=\"(prefers-color-scheme: light)\" srcset=\"https://storage.googleapis.com/coderabbit_public_assets/review-stack-buttons-v1/explain-change.svg\"><img src=\"https://storage.googleapis.com/coderabbit_public_assets/review-stack-buttons-v1/explain-change.svg\" alt=\"Explain Change \u2192\" height=\"32\"></picture></a>\n\n<!-- review_stack_entry_end -->\n<!-- recent_review_status_start -->\n\nNo actionable comments were generated in the recent review.\n\n<!-- recent_review_status_end -->\n<!-- walkthrough_start -->\n\n<details>\n<summary><strong>Walkthrough</strong></summary>\n<dl>\n<dd>\n<br>\n\n<!-- coderabbit_walkthrough_overview_removed -->\n\n**Changes: Delivery index**\n\n|Layer / File(s)|Summary|\n|:---|:---|\n|**Index undelivered deliveries** <br> `migrations/002_pending_by_queue.sql`|Adds the `deliveries_due_by_queue` index on `queue`, `scheduled_at`, and `id` for rows where `delivered_at IS NULL`.|\n\n</dd>\n</dl>\n</details>\n\n<!-- walkthrough_end -->\n<!-- change_assessment_start -->\n<!-- change_assessment_commit:\"68ef658388c5cc9ec890d030918fb6a0b36ea369\" -->\n<!-- change_assessment_priority:{\"version\":1,\"urgency\":\"p3\",\"manual\":false} -->\n**Change:** Refactor\n<!-- change_assessment_end -->\n<details>\n<summary><strong>Merge Risk:</strong> <strong><picture><img src=\"https://storage.googleapis.com/coderabbit_public_assets/review-comment-icons-v1/risk-unassessed-16.svg\" width=\"16\" height=\"16\" align=\"absmiddle\" alt=\"\"></picture> Minimal</strong> \u00b7 up to <code>68ef6</code></summary>\n<dl>\n<dd>\n<br>\n\n<!-- final_review_risk_start -->\n<!-- final_review_risk_label\n**Merge Risk:** **\u26aa Minimal** \u00b7 up to `68ef6`\n-->\n<!-- final_review_risk_coverage:{\"sourceCommitId\":\"68ef658388c5cc9ec890d030918fb6a0b36ea369\",\"coveredCommitId\":\"68ef658388c5cc9ec890d030918fb6a0b36ea369\",\"kind\":\"reviewed\"} -->\n\nThis adds an index to speed up due-delivery lookups and does not change query behavior. No actionable merge risk was identified.\n<!-- final_review_risk_end -->\n\n</dd>\n</dl>\n</details>\n\n<details>\n<summary><strong>Security architecture risk:</strong> <strong><picture><img src=\"https://storage.googleapis.com/coderabbit_public_assets/review-comment-icons-v1/risk-unassessed-16.svg\" width=\"16\" height=\"16\" align=\"absmiddle\" alt=\"\"></picture> Minimal</strong> \u00b7 up to <code>68ef6</code></summary>\n<dl>\n<dd>\n<br>\n\n<!-- architecture_review_start -->\n<!-- architecture_review_label\n### Security Architecture Review\n\n**Security architecture risk:** **\u26aa Minimal** \u00b7 up to `68ef6`\n-->\n\nThe change adds an index without changing delivery selection, data constraints, or access controls. The inspected migration path couples index creation with its version update. No introduced or worsened security or material rollback failure was identified.\n\n**Retained concerns**\nNo architecture-level concerns identified.\n\n<details>\n<summary><strong>Security review details</strong></summary>\n<dl>\n<dd>\n<br>\n\n**Security Blast Radius**\n- _inferred_ \u2014 The changed persistent structure is confined to an index over existing queue, scheduled_at, and id values in the deliveries database. The migration introduces no new network destination, credential, permission grant, or external-service dependency.\n\n**Trust Boundaries and Controls**\n- _observed_ \u2014 The delivery consumer supplies queue and now as bound SQL parameters. The new index contains no input